  "note": "Peter Fredriksson is a Swedish labor economist and Professor of Economics at Uppsala University. He has previously been at Stockholm University and is associated with IFAU (Institute for Evaluation of Labour Market and Education Policy, Uppsala) and the UCLS network. He has served on the Nobel economics committee for several years and, to my recollection, chaired it around 2021–2022. I recall him presenting the 2021 prize to Card, Angrist and Imbens as chair (medium confidence on the exact years)."
